cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use or build on this design, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "WasteWise Scan"
abstract: "Handheld near-infrared scanner that identifies common plastic resins (PET, HDPE, PP, PS, PVC) in about a second using a low-cost multispectral sensor, shows the result and a local price grade, and logs scans. It pairs with WasteWise-ml for items the spectrum cannot resolve."
